{"id": "3018997", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3018997", "title": "Swiss Indoors 2023 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Swiss Indoors 2023 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii octombrie 2023. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Basel, Elve\u021bia, jucat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103, acoperite. Ivan Dodig \u0219i Austin Krajicek au fost campionii en-titre, dar au pierdut \u00een sferturi \u00een fa\u021ba echipei Nys \u0219i Zieli\u0144ski.\nSantiago Gonz\u00e1lez \u0219i \u00c9douard Roger-Vasselin au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la Swiss Indoors 2023, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-i \u00een final\u0103 pe Hugo Nys \u0219i Jan Zieli\u0144ski cu 6\u20137(8\u201310), 7\u20136(7\u20133), [10\u20131].\nKrajicek \u0219i-a p\u0103strat locul 1 ATP la dublu, dup\u0103 ce Wesley Koolhof a pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 la Erste Bank Open 2023."}
